R(7871,"Aniquile os invasores!",[[description="Há um campo de batalhas e destruição do outro lado deste túnel, jovem $c. A Horda continua cortando as nossas sempre-vivas para abastecer as máquinas de guerra e isso tem contribuído para o extermínio da floresta sagrada.$B$BVá à Ravina Brado Guerreiro e defenda o Castelo Asa de Prata. Contenha as forças invasoras da Horda!$B$BVocê receberá um talismã de mérito por isso. Traga-o a mim, $N, e você será $grecompensado:recompensada;.",objectives={"Vá à Ravina Brado Guerreiro, derrote a Horda, obtenha uma Marca de Honra da Ravina Brado Guerreiro e a entregue à Sentinela Cantálgures no Bosque Asa de Prata."}]])
R(7872,"Aniquile os invasores!",[[description="Beyond this tunnel you will find a field of strife and turmoil, young $c. The Horde continue to decimate our sacred forest, cutting down the evergreen foliage to power their machines of war.$B$BEnter Warsong Gulch and defend Silverwing Hold. Push back the invading Horde forces!$B$BDo this, and earn a Mark of Honor.  Bring it to me, $N, and I shall reward you.",objectives={"Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Horde, obtain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and return to Sentinel Farsong at the Silverwing Grove."}]])
R(7873,"Aniquile os invasores!",[[description="Beyond this tunnel you will find a field of strife and turmoil, young $c. The Horde continue to decimate our sacred forest, cutting down the evergreen foliage to power their machines of war.$B$BEnter Warsong Gulch and defend Silverwing Hold. Push back the invading Horde forces!$B$BDo this, and earn a Mark of Honor.  Bring it to me, $N, and I shall reward you.",objectives={"Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Horde, obtain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and return to Sentinel Farsong at the Silverwing Grove."}]])
R(7874,"Domine os usurpadores da Asa de Prata",[[description="Os selvagens da floresta do Vale Gris não resistirão ao poder da Horda, $r. Nada que os Asa de Prata digam ou façam poderá abalar a nossa soberania. Kalimdor pertence à Horda. É muita ousadia deles tentar impedir que tomemos o que é nosso de direito!$B$BAcalente o orgulho de impedir as pífias tentativas deles de retardar nosso avanço. Aniquile as Sentinelas da Asa de Prata e obtenha uma marca de honra do Brado Guerreiro. Traga a marca para mim e eu $go:a; recompensarei, $N.",objectives={"Vá à Ravina Brado Guerreiro, derrote a Aliança, obtenha uma Marca de Honra da Ravina Brado Guerreiro e a entregue ao Capitão Estilhaça-crânio no Campo-base Mor'shan."}]])
R(7875,"Domine os usurpadores da Asa de Prata",[[description="The wilds of the Ashenvale forest will succumb to the might of the Horde, $r. Nothing the Silverwing say or do can stop our sovereign imperative. Kalimdor belongs to the Horde. How dare they attempt to prevent us from harvesting what is rightfully ours!$B$BLet the pride swell in your chest as you cut down their weak attempts at slowing our progress. Destroy the Silverwing Sentinels, and earn a Warsong mark of honor.  Return to me with such a mark, $N, and you will be rewarded.$B",objectives={"Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Alliance, gain a Warsong Mark of Honor, and bring it to Captain Shatterskull at the Mor'shan Base Camp."}]])
R(7876,"Domine os usurpadores da Asa de Prata",[[description="The wilds of the Ashenvale forest will succumb to the might of the Horde, $r. Nothing the Silverwing say or do can stop our sovereign imperative. Kalimdor belongs to the Horde. How dare they attempt to prevent us from harvesting what is rightfully ours!$B$BLet the pride swell in your chest as you cut down their weak attempts at slowing our progress. Destroy the Silverwing Sentinels, and earn a Mark of Honor.  Return to me with such a Mark, $N, and you will be rewarded.",objectives={"Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Alliance, gain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and bring it to Captain Shatterskull at the Mor'shan Base Camp."}]])
R(7877,"O tesouro de Shen'dralar",[[description="In the library, Athenaeum, you will find an ancient chest hidden beneath the stairway. Take from it that which you desire.",objectives={"Return to the Athenaeum and find the Treasure of the Shen'dralar. Claim your reward!"}]])
