R(8827,"Presentes de inverno",[[description="I hear Greatfather Winter - with the generous support of Smokeywood Pastures - has put presents for everyone under the tree in Ironforge. I wish I could go, but I've got to look after the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.$b$bBut you should definitely check it out. I'm sure Greatfather Winter has some presents with your name on them.",objectives={"Speak with Greatfather Winter. He is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Ironforge."}]])
R(8828,"Presentes de inverno",[[description="Ouvi dizer que o Papai Inverno, com a ajuda da Fazenda Bosque Defumado, colocou presentes para a galera lá debaixo da árvore, em Orgrimmar. Eu queria dar um pulo lá, mas tenho que tomar conta do Voltímato de Inverno PX-238.$b$bMas não deixa de passar lá, não. Garanto que o Papai Inverno tem presentes para você também!",objectives={"Fale com o Papai Inverno. Ele está perto dos vendedores da Fazenda Bosque Defumado, em Orgrimmar."}]])
R(8829,"A grande enganação",[[description="The Twilight's Hammer operates through innumerable layers of secrecy and deceit.  While their actions are carried out in our world, they are planned in a place we have not yet been able to reach.$B$BWe've come to believe that the stones the Twilight's Hammer uses to summon their superiors allow for two-way transportation.  To attempt to use them in this manner, we must replicate - to every last detail - a twilight emissary's robe.$B$BGather the necessary materials and bring them to Aurel Goldleaf, $N.  ",objectives={"Bring a Skin of Shadow, 3 Frayed Abomination Stitchings and 1 Twilight Cultist Robe to Aurel Goldleaf at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing XI in order to complete this quest."}]])
