R(9007,"Deixando o melhor para o final",[[description="A truly amazing story, $N! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.$B$BAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",objectives={"Give Mokvar your Wildheart Cowl and Wildheart Vest."}]])
